$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Similarly, a mixture of the carboxylic acid
derivative of 2 or 7 (1.0 equiv), the desired O-Me or O-Bn protected
amino acid (1.5 equiv), HBTU (3.0 equiv), and DIEA (4.0 equiv) in
anhydrous DMF (0.25 mM) was stirred under an Ar atmosphere at ambient
temperature for 8-12 h.
