7.50 (m, 2H), 5.14 (s, 2H), 2.69 (m, 1H), 2.42 (m, 1H), 2.29 (s, 3H),
1.72 (m, 1H), 1.60 (m, 1H). Calculated for C24H20F3N4O3 [M + H]+, 469.14.
